1. Scope and definitions

This license covers the Slidebaby / brite-compose skill and the Brite template
implementation supplied by Daniel Mansz, including its code, agent instructions,
documentation and reusable layouts (the "Software"), only to the extent that
Daniel Mansz holds rights to license them. A "Modified Version" is a copy or
adaptation containing copyright-protected parts of the Software, whether renamed,
rebranded, translated, repackaged or combined with other material. Third-party
materials and your own content are addressed in section 6.

"Presentation Outputs" are actual presentations created or edited using the
Software for communication, viewing or further editing. They include PDF files,
standalone HTML viewers, slide content, exported images and editable presentation
projects or project ZIPs, including copies of the Software embedded or bundled
in those outputs by the presentation workflow.

