license to download, install, run, copy, inspect and modify the Software to create,
edit and deliver Presentation Outputs. This permission applies to personal,
educational, nonprofit and commercial work, including paid work for clients.
No payment to Daniel Mansz is required for these permitted uses.

You may share unmodified copies and Modified Versions without charge under this
